{"real": false, "dur": 98.73, "sent": [{"start": 0.4, "end": 2.71, "text": "How do you build a catalogue?", "words": [{"w": "How", "s": 0.4}, {"w": "do", "s": 0.78}, {"w": "you", "s": 1.17}, {"w": "build", "s": 1.55}, {"w": "a", "s": 1.94}, {"w": "catalogue?", "s": 2.32}]}, {"start": 3.06, "end": 8.06, "text": "From three sources: the textbook, the teacher’s guide and the publisher’s unit tests.", "words": [{"w": "From", "s": 3.06}, {"w": "three", "s": 3.44}, {"w": "sources:", "s": 3.83}, {"w": "the", "s": 4.21}, {"w": "textbook,", "s": 4.6}, {"w": "the", "s": 4.98}, {"w": "teacher’s", "s": 5.37}, {"w": "guide", "s": 5.75}, {"w": "and", "s": 6.13}, {"w": "the", "s": 6.52}, {"w": "publisher’s", "s": 6.9}, {"w": "unit", "s": 7.29}, {"w": "tests.", "s": 7.67}]}, {"start": 8.41, "end": 13.79, "text": "If a unit test asks for something, it counts as taught in that unit.", "words": [{"w": "If", "s": 8.41}, {"w": "a", "s": 8.79}, {"w": "unit", "s": 9.18}, {"w": "test", "s": 9.56}, {"w": "asks", "s": 9.95}, {"w": "for", "s": 10.33}, {"w": "something,", "s": 10.72}, {"w": "it", "s": 11.1}, {"w": "counts", "s": 11.48}, {"w": "as", "s": 11.87}, {"w": "taught", "s": 12.25}, {"w": "in", "s": 12.64}, {"w": "that", "s": 13.02}, {"w": "unit.", "s": 13.41}]}, {"start": 14.14, "end": 21.83, "text": "So whenever I decide that something belongs in a particular unit, I need evidence from one of those three sources.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 14.14}, {"w": "whenever", "s": 14.53}, {"w": "I", "s": 14.91}, {"w": "decide", "s": 15.3}, {"w": "that", "s": 15.68}, {"w": "something", "s": 16.07}, {"w": "belongs", "s": 16.45}, {"w": "in", "s": 16.83}, {"w": "a", "s": 17.22}, {"w": "particular", "s": 17.6}, {"w": "unit,", "s": 17.99}, {"w": "I", "s": 18.37}, {"w": "need", "s": 18.76}, {"w": "evidence", "s": 19.14}, {"w": "from", "s": 19.53}, {"w": "one", "s": 19.91}, {"w": "of", "s": 20.3}, {"w": "those", "s": 20.68}, {"w": "three", "s": 21.07}, {"w": "sources.", "s": 21.45}]}, {"start": 22.18, "end": 26.42, "text": "I can’t just include something because I happen to know it.", "words": [{"w": "I", "s": 22.18}, {"w": "can’t", "s": 22.57}, {"w": "just", "s": 22.95}, {"w": "include", "s": 23.34}, {"w": "something", "s": 23.72}, {"w": "because", "s": 24.11}, {"w": "I", "s": 24.49}, {"w": "happen", "s": 24.88}, {"w": "to", "s": 25.26}, {"w": "know", "s": 25.65}, {"w": "it.", "s": 26.03}]}, {"start": 26.77, "end": 27.53, "text": "Some examples.", "words": [{"w": "Some", "s": 26.77}, {"w": "examples.", "s": 27.15}]}, {"start": 27.88, "end": 31.73, "text": "“Quarter past” and “half past” aren’t in the French course.", "words": [{"w": "“Quarter", "s": 27.88}, {"w": "past”", "s": 28.27}, {"w": "and", "s": 28.65}, {"w": "“half", "s": 29.04}, {"w": "past”", "s": 29.42}, {"w": "aren’t", "s": 29.81}, {"w": "in", "s": 30.19}, {"w": "the", "s": 30.58}, {"w": "French", "s": 30.96}, {"w": "course.", "s": 31.35}]}, {"start": 32.08, "end": 36.31, "text": "The book tells the time as “nine fifteen” and “nine thirty.”", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 32.08}, {"w": "book", "s": 32.47}, {"w": "tells", "s": 32.85}, {"w": "the", "s": 33.23}, {"w": "time", "s": 33.62}, {"w": "as", "s": 34.0}, {"w": "“nine", "s": 34.39}, {"w": "fifteen”", "s": 34.77}, {"w": "and", "s": 35.16}, {"w": "“nine", "s": 35.54}, {"w": "thirty.”", "s": 35.93}]}, {"start": 36.66, "end": 39.74, "text": "“Noon” and “midnight” are in, in Unit 2.", "words": [{"w": "“Noon”", "s": 36.66}, {"w": "and", "s": 37.05}, {"w": "“midnight”", "s": 37.43}, {"w": "are", "s": 37.82}, {"w": "in,", "s": 38.2}, {"w": "in", "s": 38.58}, {"w": "Unit", "s": 38.97}, {"w": "2.", "s": 39.35}]}, {"start": 40.09, "end": 45.47, "text": "Whenever the book introduces a verb, learners practise it with all nine subject pronouns.", "words": [{"w": "Whenever", "s": 40.09}, {"w": "the", "s": 40.47}, {"w": "book", "s": 40.86}, {"w": "introduces", "s": 41.24}, {"w": "a", "s": 41.63}, {"w": "verb,", "s": 42.01}, {"w": "learners", "s": 42.4}, {"w": "practise", "s": 42.78}, {"w": "it", "s": 43.17}, {"w": "with", "s": 43.55}, {"w": "all", "s": 43.93}, {"w": "nine", "s": 44.32}, {"w": "subject", "s": 44.7}, {"w": "pronouns.", "s": 45.09}]}, {"start": 45.82, "end": 53.13, "text": "And in Chinese, Lesson 11 teaches the time with its own words for “a quarter,” “three quarters” and “half.”", "words": [{"w": "And", "s": 45.82}, {"w": "in", "s": 46.21}, {"w": "Chinese,", "s": 46.59}, {"w": "Lesson", "s": 46.98}, {"w": "11", "s": 47.36}, {"w": "teaches", "s": 47.75}, {"w": "the", "s": 48.13}, {"w": "time", "s": 48.52}, {"w": "with", "s": 48.9}, {"w": "its", "s": 49.28}, {"w": "own", "s": 49.67}, {"w": "words", "s": 50.05}, {"w": "for", "s": 50.44}, {"w": "“a", "s": 50.82}, {"w": "quarter,”", "s": 51.21}, {"w": "“three", "s": 51.59}, {"w": "quarters”", "s": 51.98}, {"w": "and", "s": 52.36}, {"w": "“half.”", "s": 52.75}]}, {"start": 53.48, "end": 56.17, "text": "So the Chinese course will teach them.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 53.48}, {"w": "the", "s": 53.87}, {"w": "Chinese", "s": 54.25}, {"w": "course", "s": 54.63}, {"w": "will", "s": 55.02}, {"w": "teach", "s": 55.4}, {"w": "them.", "s": 55.79}]}, {"start": 56.52, "end": 59.22, "text": "Now, I have to be honest here.", "words": [{"w": "Now,", "s": 56.52}, {"w": "I", "s": 56.91}, {"w": "have", "s": 57.29}, {"w": "to", "s": 57.68}, {"w": "be", "s": 58.06}, {"w": "honest", "s": 58.45}, {"w": "here.", "s": 58.83}]}, {"start": 59.57, "end": 65.33, "text": "When I checked the first French version against the book, it went way past it.", "words": [{"w": "When", "s": 59.57}, {"w": "I", "s": 59.95}, {"w": "checked", "s": 60.33}, {"w": "the", "s": 60.72}, {"w": "first", "s": 61.1}, {"w": "French", "s": 61.49}, {"w": "version", "s": 61.87}, {"w": "against", "s": 62.26}, {"w": "the", "s": 62.64}, {"w": "book,", "s": 63.03}, {"w": "it", "s": 63.41}, {"w": "went", "s": 63.8}, {"w": "way", "s": 64.18}, {"w": "past", "s": 64.57}, {"w": "it.", "s": 64.95}]}, {"start": 65.68, "end": 69.92, "text": "Twelve colours in the first unit, when the book has two.", "words": [{"w": "Twelve", "s": 65.68}, {"w": "colours", "s": 66.07}, {"w": "in", "s": 66.45}, {"w": "the", "s": 66.84}, {"w": "first", "s": 67.22}, {"w": "unit,", "s": 67.61}, {"w": "when", "s": 67.99}, {"w": "the", "s": 68.38}, {"w": "book", "s": 68.76}, {"w": "has", "s": 69.15}, {"w": "two.", "s": 69.53}]}, {"start": 70.27, "end": 74.11, "text": "“Why” taught four units before the book gets to it.", "words": [{"w": "“Why”", "s": 70.27}, {"w": "taught", "s": 70.65}, {"w": "four", "s": 71.03}, {"w": "units", "s": 71.42}, {"w": "before", "s": 71.8}, {"w": "the", "s": 72.19}, {"w": "book", "s": 72.57}, {"w": "gets", "s": 72.96}, {"w": "to", "s": 73.34}, {"w": "it.", "s": 73.73}]}, {"start": 74.46, "end": 80.23, "text": "And a pre-test that marked learners on “half past two,” which the book never teaches.", "words": [{"w": "And", "s": 74.46}, {"w": "a", "s": 74.85}, {"w": "pre-test", "s": 75.23}, {"w": "that", "s": 75.62}, {"w": "marked", "s": 76.0}, {"w": "learners", "s": 76.38}, {"w": "on", "s": 76.77}, {"w": "“half", "s": 77.15}, {"w": "past", "s": 77.54}, {"w": "two,”", "s": 77.92}, {"w": "which", "s": 78.31}, {"w": "the", "s": 78.69}, {"w": "book", "s": 79.08}, {"w": "never", "s": 79.46}, {"w": "teaches.", "s": 79.85}]}, {"start": 80.58, "end": 84.43, "text": "Every one of those choices seemed helpful at the time.", "words": [{"w": "Every", "s": 80.58}, {"w": "one", "s": 80.97}, {"w": "of", "s": 81.35}, {"w": "those", "s": 81.73}, {"w": "choices", "s": 82.12}, {"w": "seemed", "s": 82.5}, {"w": "helpful", "s": 82.89}, {"w": "at", "s": 83.27}, {"w": "the", "s": 83.66}, {"w": "time.", "s": 84.04}]}, {"start": 84.78, "end": 89.39, "text": "But learners were being marked on things the course hadn’t taught them.", "words": [{"w": "But", "s": 84.78}, {"w": "learners", "s": 85.16}, {"w": "were", "s": 85.55}, {"w": "being", "s": 85.93}, {"w": "marked", "s": 86.32}, {"w": "on", "s": 86.7}, {"w": "things", "s": 87.08}, {"w": "the", "s": 87.47}, {"w": "course", "s": 87.85}, {"w": "hadn’t", "s": 88.24}, {"w": "taught", "s": 88.62}, {"w": "them.", "s": 89.01}]}, {"start": 89.74, "end": 92.05, "text": "That’s why I introduced the catalogue.", "words": [{"w": "That’s", "s": 89.74}, {"w": "why", "s": 90.13}, {"w": "I", "s": 90.51}, {"w": "introduced", "s": 90.9}, {"w": "the", "s": 91.28}, {"w": "catalogue.", "s": 91.67}]}, {"start": 92.4, "end": 97.78, "text": "And I want the site to check those limits automatically whenever I update it.", "words": [{"w": "And", "s": 92.4}, {"w": "I", "s": 92.78}, {"w": "want", "s": 93.17}, {"w": "the", "s": 93.55}, {"w": "site", "s": 93.94}, {"w": "to", "s": 94.32}, {"w": "check", "s": 94.71}, {"w": "those", "s": 95.09}, {"w": "limits", "s": 95.48}, {"w": "automatically", "s": 95.86}, {"w": "whenever", "s": 96.25}, {"w": "I", "s": 96.63}, {"w": "update", "s": 97.02}, {"w": "it.", "s": 97.4}]}]}